	["{npc:16032} wants a {item:22224} (the Eldreth ghosts of Dire Maul West, best the Eldreth Seethers, and the invisible spectres around {npc:11496}'s prison), 4 Dark Runes (the necromancers and summoners of {area:2057}, whose gate opens to a {item:13704}: one in the group is enough; or the auction house) and 8 Large Brilliant Shards (enchanters, or the auction house)."] = "{npc:16032} quiere {item:22224} (los fantasmas Eldreth de La Masacre Oeste, mejor los Eldreth Seethers, y los espectros invisibles alrededor de la prisión de {npc:11496}), 4 runas oscuras (los nigromantes e invocadores de {area:2057}, cuya puerta se abre con {item:13704}: basta con uno en el grupo; o la casa de subastas) y 8 fragmentos brillantes grandes (encantadores, o la casa de subastas).",

	-- Step 27: The Challenge
	-- {npc:16032} Falrin Treeshaper · {item:21986} Banner of Provocation · {area:1584} Blackrock Depths
	["{npc:16032} finishes the {item:21986}: plant it in the Ring of Law in {area:1584}."] = "{npc:16032} termina {item:21986}: plántalo en el Anillo de la Ley en {area:1584}.",

	-- Step 28: Blackrock Depths: the Ring of Law
	-- {area:1584} Blackrock Depths
	["{area:1584}: the Ring of Law"] = "{area:1584}: el Anillo de la Ley",
	-- {area:1584} Blackrock Depths · {area:254} Blackrock Mountain · {zone:1427} Searing Gorge · {zone:1428} Burning Steppes · {npc:10096} High Justice Grimstone · {item:21986} Banner of Provocation · {npc:16059} Theldren · {item:22047} Top Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
	["{area:1584} is the dungeon inside {area:254}, between the {zone:1427} and the {zone:1428}; a group of five. Walk into the Ring of Law so {npc:10096} sentences you, and while he reads the sentence plant the {item:21986} in the middle of the ring. After the first wave, {npc:16059} and his gladiators come instead of the usual boss: five elites who fight like players (crowd control, dispels, no taunts). Kill them all; {npc:16059} drops the {item:22047}."] = "{area:1584} es el calabozo dentro de {area:254}, entre {zone:1427} y {zone:1428}; un grupo de cinco. Entra al Anillo de la Ley para que {npc:10096} te sentencie, y mientras lee la sentencia coloca {item:21986} en el centro del anillo. Tras la primera oleada, en lugar del jefe habitual llegan {npc:16059} y sus gladiadores: cinco élites que pelean como jugadores (control de masas, disipaciones, sin provocar). Mátalos a todos; {npc:16059} suelta {item:22047}.",
	-- {item:21986} Banner of Provocation
	["{item:21986}, in the ring"] = "{item:21986}, en el anillo",

	-- Step 29: Anthion Harmon: Anthion's Parting Words
	-- {npc:16016} Anthion Harmon · {area:2279} Stratholme · {quest:84186} Anthion's Parting Words · {item:16734} Boots of Valor · {npc:10506} Kirtonos the Herald · {area:2057} Scholomance · {item:16732} Legplates of Valor · {npc:10440} Baron Rivendare · {item:16733} Spaulders of Valor · {npc:10429} Warchief Rend Blackhand
	["Back to {npc:16016} at {area:2279}'s gate (Ghost Revealer). {quest:84186} takes your {item:16734}: {npc:10506} in {area:2057} (about 19%), your {item:16732}: {npc:10440} in {area:2279} (about 11%), and your {item:16733}: {npc:10429} in Upper Blackrock Spire (about 19%)."] = "Vuelve con {npc:16016} en la puerta de {area:2279} (Revelador de fantasmas). {quest:84186} se lleva tu {item:16734}: {npc:10506} en {area:2057} (alrededor del 19 %), tu {item:16732}: {npc:10440} en {area:2279} (alrededor del 11 %), y tu {item:16733}: {npc:10429} en la Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior (alrededor del 19 %).",

	-- Step 32: Bodley
	-- {npc:16033} Bodley · {area:1583} Blackrock Spire · {area:254} Blackrock Mountain · {quest:8961} Three Kings of Flame · {item:21987} Incendicite of Incendius · {npc:9017} Lord Incendius · {area:1584} Blackrock Depths · {item:21988} Ember of Emberseer · {npc:9816} Pyroguard Emberseer · {item:21989} Cinder of Cynders · {npc:15206} Duke of Cynders · {zone:1451} Silithus · {item:22014} Hallowed Brazier · {faction:529} Argent Dawn
	["{npc:16033}'s ghost stands on the ledge before the {area:1583} portal, high inside {area:254}: use the Ghost Revealer there. {quest:8961} wants the {item:21987} ({npc:9017} in {area:1584}), the {item:21988} ({npc:9816} in Upper Blackrock Spire), the {item:21989} (the {npc:15206} in {zone:1451}) and a {item:22014} from the {faction:529}."] = "El fantasma de {npc:16033} está en la cornisa frente al portal de {area:1583}, en lo alto dentro de {area:254}: usa ahí el Revelador de fantasmas. {quest:8961} pide {item:21987} ({npc:9017} en {area:1584}), {item:21988} ({npc:9816} en Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior), {item:21989} ({npc:15206} en {zone:1451}) y {item:22014} de {faction:529}.",

	-- Step 34: Honored with the Argent Dawn
	-- {faction:529} Argent Dawn
	["Honored with the {faction:529}"] = "Honorable con {faction:529}",
	-- {item:22014} Hallowed Brazier · {item:12846} Argent Dawn Commission · {npc:10840} Argent Officer Pureheart · {area:3197} Chillwind Camp · {npc:10839} Argent Officer Garush · {npc:11039} Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff · {area:2268} Light's Hope Chapel · {area:2279} Stratholme · {area:2057} Scholomance
	["The {item:22014} is sold only to Honored. Take the {item:12846} ({npc:10840} at {area:3197}, {npc:10839} at the Bulwark, or {npc:11039} at {area:2268}) and wear it: Scourgestones then drop from the Scourge, and the Argent officers take them back for reputation. Every Scourge kill in the Plaguelands counts, {area:2279}'s and {area:2057}'s undead give 5 each up to Honored, and {area:2268}'s dungeon quests give 100-200 each. Polestar's Argent Dawn Reputation guide (Reputation) walks it step by step."] = "{item:22014} solo se vende con Honorable. Toma {item:12846} ({npc:10840} en {area:3197}, {npc:10839} en el Baluarte o {npc:11039} en {area:2268}) y equípala: entonces la Plaga suelta piedras de la Plaga, y los oficiales Argenta las reciben a cambio de reputación. Cuenta cada muerte de la Plaga en las Tierras de la Peste; los no-muertos de {area:2279} y {area:2057} dan 5 cada uno hasta Honorable, y las misiones del calabozo de {area:2268} dan 100-200 cada una. La guía de Reputación con El Alba Argenta de Polestar (Reputación) lo explica paso a paso.",

	-- Step 35: Hallowed Brazier
	-- {object:2160} The Argent Dawn · {area:2268} Light's Hope Chapel · {area:3197} Chillwind Camp
	["{object:2160} quartermasters ({area:2268}, {area:3197}, the Bulwark) sell it: 133 gold 33 silver, less with your reputation discount."] = "Lo venden los intendentes de {object:2160} ({area:2268}, {area:3197}, el Baluarte): 133 de oro 33 de plata, menos con tu descuento por reputación.",

	-- Step 36: Blackrock Depths and Upper Blackrock Spire
	-- {area:1584} Blackrock Depths
	["{area:1584} and Upper Blackrock Spire"] = "{area:1584} y Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior",
	-- {npc:9017} Lord Incendius · {object:174825} Black Anvil · {area:1584} Blackrock Depths · {npc:9816} Pyroguard Emberseer
	["{npc:9017} guards the {object:174825} in {area:1584} (a group of five). {npc:9816} is the first boss of Upper Blackrock Spire, a group of up to ten. Each player with the quest loots their own."] = "{npc:9017} custodia {object:174825} en {area:1584} (un grupo de cinco). {npc:9816} es el primer jefe de Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior, un grupo de hasta diez. Cada jugador con la misión saquea el suyo.",
	-- {npc:9816} Pyroguard Emberseer
	["{npc:9816}, Upper Blackrock Spire"] = "{npc:9816}, Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior",

	-- Step 37: Duke of Cynders
	-- {zone:1451} Silithus · {item:20422} Twilight Cultist Medallion of Station · {npc:15282} Aurel Goldleaf · {area:3425} Cenarion Hold · {item:14344} Large Brilliant Shard · {item:20432} Signet of Beckoning: Fire · {npc:15206} Duke of Cynders
	-- plural, as words: Greater Wind Stones = {object:180466} Greater Wind Stone · Abyssal Crests = {item:20513} Abyssal Crest
	["The Duke (level 62 elite, bring a group of five) only comes when someone summons him at one of the Twilight's Greater Wind Stones in {zone:1451}: the summoner wears the full Twilight Cultist set (Cowl, Mantle and Robe, from the Twilight cultists of the {zone:1451} camps), carries a {item:20422} ({npc:15282} at {area:3425}: three Abyssal Crests from summoned Templars and a {item:14344}) and a {item:20432}, which calls the {npc:15206} rather than a random Duke. Joining someone else's summon is the quick way: every player with the quest loots their own Cinder."] = "El Duque (Élite de nivel 62, lleva un grupo de cinco) solo aparece cuando alguien lo invoca en una de las Piedras de viento mayores Crepusculares de {zone:1451}: el invocador lleva el conjunto completo de Cultor Crepuscular (Capucha, Manto y Toga, de los cultores Crepusculares de los campamentos de {zone:1451}), tiene {item:20422} ({npc:15282} en {area:3425}: tres Blasones abisales de Templarios invocados y {item:14344}) y {item:20432}, que llama a {npc:15206} en vez de a un Duque al azar. Unirte a la invocación de otro es lo más rápido: cada jugador con la misión despoja su propia Ceniza.",

	-- Step 38: Bodley: Components of Importance
	-- {npc:16033} Bodley
	["{npc:16033}'s next task depends on your class: the piece the summoning brazier needs."] = "La siguiente tarea de {npc:16033} depende de tu clase: la pieza que necesita el blandón de invocación.",

	-- Step 40: Components of Importance: Druidical Remains
	-- {area:2744} Hive'Regal · {zone:1451} Silithus · {item:22226} Druidical Remains
	["At {area:2744}, the silithid hive in south-eastern {zone:1451}, the {area:2744} silithid (level 59-61 elites) drop the {item:22226} (players report anything from 5 to 50 kills). They are elites: bring a friend or two unless your gear is good. It drops only while you have the quest; everyone in the group with it can loot one."] = "En {area:2744}, la colmena silítida del sureste de {zone:1451}, los silítidos de {area:2744} (élites de nivel 59-61) sueltan {item:22226} (los jugadores reportan entre 5 y 50 muertes). Son élites: lleva a uno o dos amigos salvo que tu equipo sea bueno. Solo cae mientras tengas la misión; cada miembro del grupo que la tenga puede saquear uno.",

	-- Step 42: The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
	-- {npc:16033} Bodley · {item:22049} Brazier of Beckoning
	["{npc:16033} gives you a {item:22049}."] = "{npc:16033} te da {item:22049}.",

	-- Step 43: The Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: Mor Grayhoof
	-- {npc:16033} Bodley · {item:22049} Brazier of Beckoning · {npc:16080} Mor Grayhoof · {npc:9237} War Master Voone · {area:254} Blackrock Mountain
	["A dungeon run for a group of five. {npc:16033}'s {item:22049} calls {npc:16080} to {npc:9237}'s room in Lower Blackrock Spire, in {area:254}: clear the room and Voone first. Use the brazier there, kill {npc:16080} and loot the piece. He is an elite druid spirit: interrupt his heals and step out of his storm. Keep the brazier: {npc:16033} wants it back with the piece."] = "Una incursión de calabozo para un grupo de cinco. {item:22049} de {npc:16033} invoca a {npc:16080} a la sala de {npc:9237} en la Cumbre de Roca Negra Inferior, en {area:254}: primero despeja la sala y a Voone. Usa el brasero ahí, mata a {npc:16080} y saquea la pieza. Es un espíritu druida élite: interrumpe sus sanaciones y sal de su tormenta. Guarda el brasero: {npc:16033} lo quiere de vuelta con la pieza.",
	-- {item:22049} Brazier of Beckoning · {npc:16080} Mor Grayhoof
	["{item:22049}: summons {npc:16080}"] = "{item:22049}: invoca a {npc:16080}",

	-- Step 46: Bloodkelp
	-- {area:2079} Alcaz Island · {zone:1445} Dustwallow Marsh · {npc:16072} Tidelord Rrurgaz
	["The Strashaz naga of {area:2079}, off the north-east coast of {zone:1445}, carry it (level 59-61 elites, and {npc:16072} at 62): bring a friend or two. The Baskets of Bloodkelp on the island give 1 to 3 each without a fight. Swim over from the coast north of Theramore; elite hydras roam the water."] = "Los naga Strashaz de {area:2079}, frente a la costa noreste de {zone:1445}, lo llevan (Élites de nivel 59-61, y {npc:16072} de nivel 62): lleva a uno o dos amigos. Las Cestas de alga sangrienta de la isla dan de 1 a 3 cada una sin pelear. Nada desde la costa al norte de Theramore; hay hidras Élite rondando el agua.",

	-- Step 49: More Components of Importance: Starbreeze Village Relic
	-- {zone:1452} Winterspring · {area:2255} Everlook · {item:22227} Starbreeze Village Relic
	-- plural, as words: Frostmaul Giants = {npc:7428} Frostmaul Giant · Frostmaul Preservers = {npc:7429} Frostmaul Preserver
	["At the Frostmaul giants' gorge in southern {zone:1452}, south of {area:2255}, Frostmaul Giants and Frostmaul Preservers (level 59-60 elites) drop the {item:22227} (a rare drop: it can take dozens of kills). They are elites: bring a friend or two unless your gear is good. It drops only while you have the quest; everyone in the group with it can loot one."] = "En la garganta de los gigantes Mazo Escarcha, en el sur de {zone:1452}, al sur de {area:2255}, los Gigantes Mazo Escarcha y los Preservadores Mazo Escarcha (élites de nivel 59-60) sueltan {item:22227} (botín raro: puede tomar decenas de muertes). Son élites: lleva a uno o dos amigos salvo que tu equipo sea bueno. Solo cae mientras tengas la misión; cada miembro del grupo que la tenga puede saquear uno.",

	-- Step 52: The Right Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet: Isalien
	-- {npc:16033} Bodley · {item:22050} Brazier of Beckoning · {npc:16097} Isalien · {npc:11492} Alzzin the Wildshaper · {item:21984} Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet · {item:22048} Lord Valthalak's Amulet
	["A dungeon run for a group of five. {npc:16033}'s {item:22050} calls {npc:16097} to the shrine by {npc:11492} at the end of Dire Maul East: clear the area first. Use the brazier there, kill {npc:16097} and loot the piece. She is an elite priestess spirit with a hippogryph at her side and strong heals: interrupt her or drain her mana. Keep the brazier: {npc:16033} wants it back with the piece. Then use the {item:21984} ({npc:16033} gave it back to you) to join the pieces into {item:22048}."] = "Una incursión de calabozo para un grupo de cinco. {item:22050} de {npc:16033} invoca a {npc:16097} al santuario junto a {npc:11492} al final de La Masacre Este: primero despeja la zona. Usa el brasero ahí, mata a {npc:16097} y saquea la pieza. Es un espíritu sacerdotisa élite con un hipogrifo a su lado y sanaciones fuertes: interrúmpela o drena su maná. Guarda el brasero: {npc:16033} lo quiere de vuelta con la pieza. Luego usa {item:21984} ({npc:16033} te lo devolvió) para unir las piezas en {item:22048}.",
	-- {item:22050} Brazier of Beckoning · {npc:16097} Isalien
	["{item:22050}: summons {npc:16097}"] = "{item:22050}: invoca a {npc:16097}",
	-- {item:21984} Left Piece of Lord Valthalak's Amulet
	["{item:21984}: joins the pieces"] = "{item:21984}: une las piezas",

	-- Step 54: Final Preparations
	-- {area:1583} Blackrock Spire · {item:13512} Flask of Supreme Power
	-- plural, as words: Blackrock Bracers = {item:22138} Blackrock Bracer · Scarshield Grunts = {npc:9043} Scarshield Grunt
	["40 Blackrock Bracers from the Blackrock orcs of {area:1583} (the Scarshield Grunts in the mountain's halls outside the portal, level 53-54 elites, drop them most often; Upper {area:1583}'s orcs better than Lower's), only while you have the quest, and a {item:13512} (alchemists make it at an alchemy lab; or the auction house)."] = "40 Brazales Roca Negra de los orcos Roca Negra de {area:1583} (los Gruñones Rajascudo en las salas de la montaña fuera del portal, élites de nivel 53-54, son los que más los sueltan; los orcos de {area:1583} Superior mejor que los de la Inferior), solo mientras tengas la misión, y {item:13512} (los alquimistas lo hacen en un laboratorio de alquimia; o en la casa de subastas).",

	-- Step 56: Upper Blackrock Spire: Lord Valthalak
	-- {area:1583} Blackrock Spire · {npc:16042} Lord Valthalak
	["Upper {area:1583}: {npc:16042}"] = "{area:1583} Superior: {npc:16042}",
	-- {npc:10430} The Beast · {item:22056} Brazier of Beckoning · {npc:16042} Lord Valthalak · {item:22048} Lord Valthalak's Amulet · {quest:8996} Return to Bodley
	["A raid of up to ten in Upper Blackrock Spire. Clear to {npc:10430}'s room and kill {npc:10430}, then use the {item:22056} there to call {npc:16042} (level 63 boss). Kill his shades quickly; in his last phase he hits the whole room hard. Use {item:22048} on his corpse: his spirit appears. Give him the amulet, then take {quest:8996} from him."] = "Una banda de hasta diez en la Cumbre de Roca Negra Superior. Despeja hasta la sala de {npc:10430} y mata a {npc:10430}, luego usa {item:22056} ahí para invocar a {npc:16042} (jefe de nivel 63). Mata rápido a sus sombras; en su última fase golpea fuerte a toda la sala. Usa {item:22048} sobre su cadáver: aparece su espíritu. Dale el amuleto y luego acepta {quest:8996} de él.",
	-- {item:22056} Brazier of Beckoning · {npc:10430} The Beast
	["{item:22056}, in {npc:10430}'s room"] = "{item:22056}, en la sala de {npc:10430}",
	-- {item:22048} Lord Valthalak's Amulet
	["{item:22048}, on his corpse"] = "{item:22048}, sobre su cadáver",

